### GET alle hytter
GET http://localhost:3030/api/cabins

### POST ny hytte
POST http://localhost:3030/api/cabins
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Testbu", "kind": "Ubetjent", "beds": 4, "region": "Nordfjell", "description": "Liten testbu" }

### PUT oppdater hytte (bytt id)
PUT http://localhost:3030/api/cabins/4
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Testbu 2", "kind": "Selvbetjent", "beds": 6, "region": "Grønnmark", "description": "Endret testbu" }

### DELETE hytte (bytt id)
DELETE http://localhost:3030/api/cabins/4

### GET turmål
GET http://localhost:3030/api/destinations

### GET alle turer
GET http://localhost:3030/api/hikes

### GET turer med filter
GET http://localhost:3030/api/hikes?difficulty=Enkel&region=Grønnmark&q=vann
